<h1 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b51f5; margin: 0 0 18px 0; text-align: center;">
    Account Activation
</h1>

<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-align: center;">
    Hello, {{firstName}} {{lastName}}! 👋
    Thank you for creating an account with us.
    To complete your registration, please confirm your email address.
</p>

<div style="text-align:center; margin: 32px 0;">
    <a href="{{activationLink}}"
       style="background:#6b51f5; color:white; padding:14px 28px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; display:inline-block;">
        Activate Account
    </a>
</div>

<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #777; margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;">
    If you did not create an account, simply ignore this email.
</p>
